-# One collapsible section of the page, the shared collapsible section
-# (shared/wsjrdp/_collapsible_section) with the page's key: its id is
-# dereg-section-<key>, and @dereg_open_sections says which stand open when the
-# page is drawn. Each section opens and closes on its own.
-#
-# A section that is edited in place names the turbo frame its body lives in
-# (`frame`), so a link or a form inside that body swaps the body alone.
- frame = local_assigns[:frame]
= render layout: "shared/wsjrdp/collapsible_section",
  locals: {id: "dereg-section-#{key}", title: title, summary: summary, action: local_assigns[:action],
           open: @dereg_open_sections.include?(key)} do
  = turbo_frame_if frame.present?, frame do
    = yield
